  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "For ten years, only Messi and Ronaldo won the Ballon d'Or. These are the two men on either side of that wall.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "title",
        "heading": "MODRIC 2018 v KAKA 2007",
        "sub": "Before and after the decade",
        "pill": "SETTLED",
        "person": "kaka"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kaka, twenty oh seven. Twenty-five, AC Milan, unstoppable on the counter.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "kaka",
        "label": "AC Milan · 2007",
        "mood": "happy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Top scorer in the Champions League with ten goals, from midfield.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "KAKA 2006-07",
        "person": "kaka",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "10",
            "l": "Champions League goals"
          },
          {
            "n": "1st",
            "l": "in the scoring chart"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Luka Modric, twenty eighteen. Thirty-three, Real Madrid, the man who ran every game.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "modric",
        "label": "Real Madrid · 2018",
        "mood": "happy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He doesn't score many. His numbers are the trophies, and the finals.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "trophies",
        "person": "modric",
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "bigears",
            "label": "Champions League 2018"
          },
          {
            "kind": "ballon",
            "label": "World Cup Golden Ball"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kaka's trophy cabinet that year: the Champions League, and the Ballon d'Or.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "trophies",
        "person": "kaka",
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "bigears",
            "label": "Champions League 2007"
          },
          {
            "kind": "ballon",
            "label": "Ballon d'Or 2007"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Now here's the twist. Both men won the Champions League final against the same club. Liverpool.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "THE TWIST",
        "body": "Milan beat Liverpool in Athens in 2007. Real Madrid beat Liverpool in Kyiv in 2018. Same victims, eleven years apart."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Milan two, Liverpool one.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "score",
        "home": "milan",
        "away": "liverpool",
        "hs": 2,
        "as": 1,
        "date": "23 May 2007",
        "comp": "Champions League final"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Real Madrid three, Liverpool one.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "score",
        "home": "realmadrid",
        "away": "liverpool",
        "hs": 3,
        "as": 1,
        "date": "26 May 2018",
        "comp": "Champions League final"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And the man who came second both times? Cristiano Ronaldo.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "list",
        "title": "RONALDO, SECOND BOTH TIMES",
        "rows": [
          {
            "name": "2007: Kaka",
            "value": "444",
            "club": "milan",
            "hl": true
          },
          {
            "name": "2007: Ronaldo",
            "value": "277",
            "club": "manutd"
          },
          {
            "name": "2018: Modric",
            "value": "753",
            "club": "realmadrid",
            "hl": true
          },
          {
            "name": "2018: Ronaldo",
            "value": "476",
            "club": "juve"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "But Modric's summer pushes him ahead. He dragged Croatia to a World Cup final. They lost four-two to France.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "score",
        "home": "fra",
        "away": "cro",
        "hs": 4,
        "as": 2,
        "date": "15 July 2018",
        "comp": "World Cup final",
        "note": "Modric wins the Golden Ball"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The vote? Modric won by two hundred and seventy-seven points. Kaka by one hundred and sixty-seven.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "title": "WINNING MARGIN",
        "left": {
          "person": "kaka",
          "label": "Kaka 2007",
          "value": "167"
        },
        "right": {
          "person": "modric",
          "label": "Modric 2018",
          "value": "277"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kaka has the goals. Modric has the bigger year. Settled: Modric.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "MODRIC",
        "person": "modric",
        "color": "white"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow for more, and play Road to Ballon d'Or at knowitball dot co dot uk.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "cta"
      }
    }
  ]
